<body>




<%- include('partials/header') %>


 <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
<main class="about-page">

  <section class="about-hero">
    <h1>ABOUT US</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="about-content">

    <div class="about-block">
      <h2>Vision:</h2>
      <p>Become epitome of style.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-block">
      <h2>Mission:</h2>
      <p>To lead men's fashion by delivering exceptional quality, sophisticated styles and proactive customer services.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-block">
      <h2>Values:</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Integrity</li>
        <li>Trust</li>
        <li>Commitment to Excellence</li>
        <li>Teamwork</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="about-block">
      <p>Royal Tag is Smart Formal Fashion Retail Brand for Men owned by Rana Trading Co. Established in 2012 with the philosophy, "Quality products and consistent customer care could only achieve long lasting success in market".</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-block">
      <p>We are continually on a journey to strengthen the relationship with our valued customer by providing contemporary products, assurance of best quality in formal and casual wear categories. Royal Tag Garments are produced to be superior in quality, sophisticated in style and aligned with modern fashion trends.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-block">
      <p>Royal Tag values its customer's loyalty and always admire their drive for success. Brand is operating nationwide including all the major markets in the country.</p>
    </div>

  </section>

</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

